      "message": "We should increment the domain\u0027s refcount before using it? Otherwise, it may be dropped down to 0 by pkvm_put_iommu_domain() and then freed by pkvm_free_iommu_domain() in the meantime on another CPU?",
      "revId": "f61cd346baefda5f6e40c03dde01678520eaf417",
